# Fleet Management System - Web App Environment Variables Example

# Optional MapTiler API Key for vector/raster tile layer on Live Fleet Map.
# If omitted, defaults to keyless Carto Voyager raster tiles.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=

# MeshSat map iframe URL for the Live Fleet Map "MeshSat Mesh Map" tab.
# Use the SAME-ORIGIN proxied path so the MeshSat login state is first-party and
# is carried inside the iframe. A relative URL ("/meshsat/map") always resolves
# against the current FMS origin, so it works on any host (prod, staging, local).
VITE_MESHSAT_MAP_URL=/meshsat/map

# NOTE: the direct cross-site URL (https://meshsat.dspng.space/map) only works if
# MeshSat permits framing (no X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors block) AND the
# browser allows third-party cookies for the frame — which Safari, Firefox and
# most Incognito sessions do NOT. It is therefore not the supported option.
